WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.041
Four people leave again.

00:02.741 --> 00:13.683
Then four people left from this coast of Florida, on a flight called Artemis Two: Reid Wiseman, Victor Glover, Christina Koch and, from Canada, Jeremy Hansen.

00:14.132 --> 00:17.912
They were the first crew to leave the Earth's neighbourhood since Apollo.
